sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Buyer
    participant App as Nubank app
    participant Nu as Nubank<br/>direct participant
    participant DICT as DICT<br/>key directory
    participant SPI as SPI<br/>settlement engine
    participant Itau as Itau
    participant Seller as Merchant

    Note over Seller: Merchant generates a dynamic QR<br/>containing a payload URL, amount,<br/>and a transaction identifier
    Seller->>Buyer: Show BR Code QR<br/>R$ 189.90

    Buyer->>App: Scan
    App->>Nu: Read payload from<br/>the merchant's PSP endpoint
    Nu->>DICT: Consult key<br/>"loja@exemplo.com.br"
    Note over DICT: Every lookup is logged and<br/>rate limited. Bulk scraping<br/>of the directory is a<br/>reportable offence.
    DICT-->>Nu: Account, ISPB, holder name,<br/>masked CPF/CNPJ
    Nu-->>App: "LOJA EXEMPLO LTDA<br/>CNPJ 12.345.456/0001-77"
    App-->>Buyer: Confirm payee and amount

    Buyer->>App: Biometric or password
    App->>Nu: Authorised

    Nu->>Nu: Balance check and debit
    Nu->>Nu: Fraud score, limit check<br/>night-time limit applies 20:00-06:00
    Nu->>SPI: pacs.008 over RSFN<br/>signed, ICP-Brasil certificate

    SPI->>SPI: Verify signature and schema
    SPI->>SPI: Check Nubank's PI account<br/>has the balance
    SPI->>SPI: Debit Nubank PI account,<br/>credit Itau PI account<br/>settlement is final here
    SPI->>Itau: pacs.008 forwarded

    Note over Itau: Hard deadline. Silence is<br/>treated as a failure.
    Itau->>Itau: Credit merchant account
    Itau-->>SPI: pacs.002 accepted
    SPI-->>Nu: pacs.002 settled
    Nu-->>App: Paid
    App-->>Buyer: Receipt with end-to-end ID<br/>E + ISPB + timestamp + suffix
    Itau->>Seller: Funds available, irrevocable

    Note over Buyer,Seller: Central bank SLA is 10 seconds.<br/>Typical is under 5.

    alt Receiver rejects or times out
        Itau-->>SPI: pacs.002 rejected
        SPI->>SPI: Reverse the PI account entries
        SPI-->>Nu: Rejected with reason code
        Nu->>Nu: Re-credit the buyer immediately
    end

    alt Buyer disputes as fraud later
        Buyer->>Nu: Open MED claim
        Nu->>SPI: pacs.004 return, reason FRAUD
        Note over SPI,Itau: Funds returned only if still<br/>sitting in the receiving account
    end
